.git/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
# Keys never enter the build context: COPY api/ /app/ would bake an api/.env into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
# Local cache snapshots and their journals are machine state, not source.
**/cache.sqlite*
console/node_modules/
console/.next/
data/build/
# The console build reads the committed metrics report and the eval sets; nothing else from these.
docs/*
!docs/metrics.md
eval/*
!eval/sets/
